editorial('/community/guidelines/','Community guidelines','FAN COMMUNITY / GUIDELINES','MAKE ROOM<br><span>FOR EACH OTHER.</span>','A few ground rules for a welcoming music community.',[('KEEP IT ABOUT THE CONNECTION',['Talk about music, creative work, and the artist’s public world. Disagree with ideas without targeting people. No harassment, threats, hate, impersonation, or repeated promotional spam.']),('SHARE WHAT IS YOURS TO SHARE',['Post only material you have permission to share. Avoid private addresses, phone numbers, financial information, or other people’s personal details. Use the private submission form for demos that you do not want to discuss publicly.']),('PUBLIC POSTS &amp; MODERATION',['Your chosen display name and messages are public. ChatGPT sign-in identifies your contributions to the site; your sign-in email is not shown with posts. You can remove your own posts and comments.','Use Report post to alert the site owner. The owner can remove posts and comments and review reported discussions. Posting limits help keep repeated messages from overwhelming the boards.']),('ANNOUNCEMENTS &amp; VOTING',['Only the site owner can publish in Announcements. The fan poll accepts one current choice per signed-in user; you can change your choice. Votes show aggregate totals rather than individual identities.'])])
